{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Legacy – Reawakening》是一款經典的點擊式冒險遊戲，玩家將扮演考古學家，深入一個被遺忘的地下世界，探索遠古結構與隱藏的科技，解開背後的神祕謎團。遊戲融合了豐富的謎題與解謎元素，適合喜愛冒險及解謎遊戲的玩家。</p>\n\n<h2>豐富謎題與沈浸式探索</h2>\n<p>遊戲提供大量且多樣化的謎題，涵蓋機械裝置、邏輯挑戰與視覺觀察等類型，確保每次體驗都新鮮有趣。玩家可在全 3D 的龐大洞穴系統中自由探索，利用 Solium 與 Aquenite 等能源，尋找失落的記憶碎片，重組機器守護者並揭開遺跡的真相。遊戲亦備有動態提示系統與多語言支援，玩家可根據喜好調整難度，享受沈浸式的冒險旅程。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2778x1284bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2778x1284bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2778x1284bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2778x1284bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2778x1284bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2778x1284bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Legacy – Reawakening</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T13:18:58.402468+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}